OL,3,GNEWSARussell Brand is a 'sexual
OL,4,Apredator who has no remorse', victim
OL,5,Atells sentencing hearing
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe woman who Brand raped in 2009 tells
OL,8,Fthe court she is "living with trauma",
OL,9,Fand feared she had contracted HIV
OL,11,FIn mitigation before sentencing,
OL,12,FBrand's lawyer says his client is "a
OL,13,Ffundamentally different person today"
OL,15,FIn total, Brand faced seven charges:
OL,16,Fthree of rape, three of sexual assault
OL,17,Fand one of attempted indecent assault.
OL,18,FHe was found not guilty on three counts
OL,20,FHis crimes took place between 2004 and
OL,21,F2009, and related to four women. They
OL,22,Fare all entitled to lifelong anonymity
